<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Lost Lake</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:115-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.563099" lon="-121.666074"><ele>389.8</ele><name>Last house on Road 13</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:lost-lake-last-house (OSM node 8938607273 on Lost Lake Road); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 117; book_elev_ft: 1270; quote: The road from Dee is plowed 3 miles to the last house (1,270 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.532409" lon="-121.743428"><ele>551.7</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 18 (Lolo Pass road) junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 33443907, junction of Lost Lake Road (FR 13) and Lolo Pass road; confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 1880; quote: This basin contains the junction with Road 18, the Lolo Pass road, at 1,880 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.520036" lon="-121.756815"><ele>671.3</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 1340 junction (Lost Lake Butte Loop start)</name><desc>source: OSM node 2377671132, FR 13 and FR 1340; confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 2200; quote: in 1.6 miles passes to the left a side road (Road 1340), the start of the Lost Lake Butte Loop</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.513828" lon="-121.779256"><ele>820.7</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 1350 (Sawtooth Mountain) junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 33439581, FR 13 and FR 1350; confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 2720; quote: Three miles beyond the Lolo Pass road junction ... a side road to the right at 2,720 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.501076" lon="-121.816549"><ele>994.5</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 1340 at the ticket booth</name><desc>source: OSM node 8930181034, where FR 13 turns right (west) and Lost Lake Road (NF 1340) goes south to the lake; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 118; quote: Near the lake, where Road 13 goes right near a campground ticket booth, follow Road 1341 0.4 mile to the lake</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.496125" lon="-121.822204"><ele>971.7</ele><name>Classic view, north end of Lost Lake</name><desc>source: end of OSM NF 1341620 (way 5039965), by Lakeshore Trailhead and OSM viewpoint 'View of Lost Lake and Mount Hood' (node 12136246301); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 3143; quote: For the classic view follow a spur road that goes a short distance around the north end of the lake. The trail around the lake begins at the road end.</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Lost Lake</name><desc>1. Last house on Road 13 -&gt; Road 13 / Road 18 (Lolo Pass road) junction: osm (high), 4.68 mi | 2. Road 13 / Road 18 (Lolo Pass road) junction -&gt; Road 13 / Road 1340 junction (Lost Lake Butte Loop start): osm (high), 1.55 mi | 3. Road 13 / Road 1340 junction (Lost Lake Butte Loop start) -&gt; Road 13 / Road 1350 (Sawtooth Mountain) junction: osm (high), 1.44 mi | 4. Road 13 / Road 1350 (Sawtooth Mountain) junction -&gt; Road 13 / Road 1340 at the ticket booth: osm (high), 2.52 mi | 5. Road 13 / Road 1340 at the ticket booth -&gt; Classic view, north end of Lost Lake: osm (medium), 0.75 mi</desc>
